speechtext:
The hon. gent'eman must remember that that is the tender for the construction of the building. In addition to that there is the cost of the site, $3,100 ; survey of site, legal and travelling expenses and other items, $835.92; heating and ventilation $2,500 ; electric wiring and fixtures, $1,000 ; fittings and furniture $1,500;
271i
sidewalk and fencing $500 ; contingencies and superintendence, $4,837. There is also to be paid to the contractor for additional work for the erection of a shooting gallery, $3,855.
